      "longDescription": "Lufthansa Innovation Hub is a Berlin based innovation company, part of the Lufthansa Group, that offers digital solutions for the next in travel and mobility. This project consists of a compilation of the work done for them between 2025 and 2026.\n\nAs part of the design team within the marketing team, my main focus was the conceptualization and design of online communication assets, while developing templates for future assets, as well as offline communication (mainly merchandising and office assets), motion graphics and photography and postproduction for employees and teams. Eventually, I've been also involved in naming and branding workshops for developing ventures.\n\nFigma –to design, templatize online assets and for product design–, After Effects –to create the motion graphics–, Claude –to automatise processes and build connections between tools– are the softwares that I've used the most. Of course, Photoshop, Illustrator and Premiere have been also used on a weekly basis.\n\nThe bulk of my work with LIH has reached both the internal Lufthansa Group audience and the external network mainly through LinkedIn and TNMT.com, but it's also present in other internal channels as well as onsite in their offices.",
