      "longDescription": "Build A Rocket is a global gaming and esports agency within the SPORTFIV family. This project was a full redesign of their website: a more modern approach, and a rethink of the UX and UI from the ground up.\n\nTheir old site no longer matched the brand: disruptive and cutting-edge, but still professional and trustworthy. I started with meetings with their design lead to align on what worked, what didn't, and what they actually needed. That fed into a moodboard, plus a review of the site's architecture to see how content was structured, which shaped a better hierarchy and user flow.\n\nFrom there: sketches, then iteration with the client until the desktop design felt right. I built out the rest of the pages, the mobile version, component rules, and text styles across breakpoints. A handoff meeting with the dev team set up the Figma file for build, and the result is now live: a fully responsive site that reflects the brand properly.",
